<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43908" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐήλιος</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐάλιος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sunny, genial</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aff.</u>
					60
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				129
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				9.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁμέραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					242
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐάλιον πῦρ</span>
			<i>the sun's</i> heat, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				1138
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. οἰκία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					1345a32
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν εὐηλίῳ</span> in <i>a sunny
				spot</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HA</u>
				616b14
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μετόπωρον εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				4.17
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίως</span>
			<i>in sunlight</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				906
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of persons,
				<i>fond of the sun, fond of basking</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				6.4
			</span></i>.</div>
